<title>JAPAN: Toyo Pile Hume Pipe plans share split.</title>
<headline>Toyo Pile Hume Pipe plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyo Pile Hume Pipe Production Co Ltd said on Thursday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on January 20, for shareholders as of November 30.</p>
</text>
